OL,3,GNEWSAConvenience store plan for disused
OL,4,Apub approved                           
OL,6,FPlans to convert a disused pub into a  
OL,7,Fconvenience store have been approved.  
OL,9,FThe shop in the former Oddfellows Arms,
OL,10,Foff North Ravensworth Street in        
OL,11,FSunderland, is expected to sell        
OL,12,Fgroceries, alcohol, tobacco and        
OL,13,Fhousehold items, the Local Democracy   
OL,14,FReporting Service said.                
OL,16,FSunderland City Council's planning     
OL,17,Fdepartment granted permission for the  
OL,18,Fstore at the building, which dates from
OL,19,Fthe late 1800s.                        
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
