OL,3,GNEWSAConvenience store plan for disused
OL,4,Apub approved                           
OL,6,FThe applicants said the shop would     
OL,7,Fcreate three jobs and they were        
OL,8,F"committed to being a good neighbour"  
OL,9,Fafter residents objected to it selling 
OL,10,Falcohol.                               
